      "content": "hey my 6yo has a really high fever, like 103.2, and he's just so uncomfortable. i have both infant tylenol and some motrin (ibuprofen) here. is it okay if i give him both at the same time so it works better and more quickly? i just want him to be able to sleep through the night.",
